<h2>How to pay less without taking risks</h2>
<ol>
<li>Compare several sections and rows for the same event.</li>
<li>Check the total with fees, not only the listed price.</li>
<li>Look at <a href="/ticket-deals">ticket deals</a> and try a <a href="/tickets-promo-code">promo code</a> if one is available.</li>
<li>Be flexible on date, or browse <a href="/concert-tickets-for-sale">concert tickets</a> for a different show.</li>
<li>Buy where you have protection: see <a href="/ticket-buyer-protection">ticket buyer protection</a> and the <a href="/worry-free-guarantee">Worry Free Guarantee</a>.</li>
</ol>
